  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AVH - Pediatric Palliative Care</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to Pediatric Palliative Medicine center (ECPMC) at Augusta Victoria Hospital (AVH) in East Jerusalem. This three-year ECPMC project will meet the need for children with life determining illness along with specialized training for health care professionals.It will also strengthen the Palestinian presence in East Jerusalem.</narrative>
  </description>
